            "contactPhone": "+27815826899",
            "contactEmail": "administrator@qwertymates.com",
            "demoAccountName": null,
            "demoAccountPassword": null,
            "demoAccountRequired": false,
            "notes": "Hello App Review Team,\r\n\r\nThank you for the 12 Aug 2026 review (Submission ID baefad44-d63e-4562-a514-a47f3ef799b3) of Qwertymates 1.0 on iPad Air 11-inch (M3). This new binary addresses both issues.\r\n\r\nGUIDELINE 3.1.1 — Payments / In-App Purchase (tips)\r\nOptional tips associated with digital content have been REMOVED from the iOS app:\r\n• Creator Donate / coffee-cup control on QwertyTV and Wall posts\r\n• “Buy me Coffee” and wallet-donate modal for creators\r\n• School-account Donate button\r\n\r\nDigital content and creator services are not sold via wallet on iOS. We did not implement StoreKit IAP in this pass; we removed the non-IAP tip flows instead.\r\n\r\nWallet Scan QR “Send money” is person-to-person funds transfer (Guideline 3.1.1(b)), not a tip for digital content. QwertyHub checkout is for physical goods (marketplace products, food, groceries) with prepaid delivery — real-world goods, not digital content.\r\n\r\nGUIDELINE 5.2.3 — Intellectual Property / audio-video\r\nQwertyTV and QwertyMusic on iOS are first-party user-generated content. Users upload their own photos, videos, and audio in-app and grant Qwertymates a license under our Terms of Service. They warrant they own or have rights to that content.\r\n\r\nThis iOS binary:\r\n• Does not embed YouTube, Spotify, SoundCloud, or Facebook video catalogs\r\n• Does not download other people’s audio/video to Photos or Files\r\n• “Bookmark” stores a post id in the app only (not a media file download)\r\n• Does not surface Facebook-ingested editorial catalog posts (those remain web/Android only)\r\n\r\nDocumentary evidence of rights and policies:\r\n• Terms of Service: https://www.qwertymates.com/policies/terms-of-service\r\n• Privacy Policy: https://www.qwertymates.com/policies/privacy-policy\r\n• Intellectual Property / copyright & DMCA: https://www.qwertymates.com/policies/intellectual-property\r\n• Acceptable Use: https://www.qwertymates.com/policies/acceptable-use\r\n\r\nTakedown / DMCA: administrator@qwertymates.com. In-app Report is available on every post.\r\n\r\nApp access: Reviewers can register a new account with any email on Sign Up. Production API: https://api.qwertymates.com. Support: administrator@qwertymates.com.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nQwertymates Team"
          }
        }
      ]
